### comanda joi dimineata
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": 3,
  "delivery_week": "2026-08-10",
  "total_amount": "50.00",
  "time_windows": [
    { "day": "thursday", "start_time": "09:00:00", "end_time": "12:00:00" }
  ]
}

### comanda cu ferestre pe ambele zile (noduri gemene)
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": 4,
  "delivery_week": "2026-08-10",
  "total_amount": "75.00",
  "time_windows": [
    { "day": "thursday", "start_time": "08:00:00", "end_time": "11:00:00" },
    { "day": "friday", "start_time": "14:00:00", "end_time": "17:00:00" }
  ]
}

### comanda doar vineri
